units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p
lattice fcc 4.05
region box block 0 5 0 5 0 5
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
mass 1 26.9815
pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * /home/holbrooe/LAMMPS-AST/publication/potentials/prompt1.potential Al
velocity all create 300.0 12345 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
timestep 0.001
fix 1 all npt temp 300.0 300.0 0.1 iso 1.01325 1.01325 1.0
thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step temp press pe ke etotal vol
run 10
